{"seq":1,"slug":"unit-testing-fundamentals","title":"单元测试基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xctest-structure","title":"XCTest 单元测试结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals/xctest-structure","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-async-networking","title":"测试异步与网络代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals/testing-async-networking","wordCount":1945,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-injection-test-doubles","title":"依赖注入与测试替身","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-testing-quality/unit-testing-fundamentals/dependency-injection-test-doubles","wordCount":2273,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 单元测试基础 简介\n\n单元测试是测试金字塔的底座——快、多、独立，守住每段逻辑的正确性。本章讲清 iOS 单元测试的基础：先是 **XCTest 的结构**（测试目标、`XCTestCase`、各种 assertion、测试的组织与运行），然后是**测试异步与网络代码**（async/await 的测试、用 mock URLSession 让网络测试快而确定），最后是**依赖注入与测试替身**（用 protocol 抽象依赖、用 mock/stub/spy 隔离被测对象）。掌握这些，你就能为逻辑写出快速、可靠、可重复的单元测试——这是工程质量的第一道防线。\n"}